  description: 'This example shows how to write to a 3D Text Mesh using

    the
    Writer component and a Write command.


    It also shows how to read text from
    a UI input field,

    store the entered value in a string variable, and then
    use the

    string variable in Write and Say commands.


    The input field
    is set to be non interactable once the player

    has entered their name using
    the Set Interactable command.'
  uiModel:
    _selectedBlocks:
    - {fileID: 163283984}
    _selectedCommands:
